						],
						"pointId": 51
					}
				]
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 150360301,
					"content": "#Ah, {NICKNAME}, Skirk!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150360302
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 150360302,
					"content": "What happened? It looked like Skirk just got—",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150360303
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 150360303,
					"content": "...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150360304
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Skirk"
				},
				{
					"id": 150360304,
					"content": "In the Guili Plains, you asked me why this enemy chose you as his target.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150360305
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Skirk"
				},
				{
					"id": 150360305,
					"content": "Now, the answer is clear. It's not just the fact that your strength is impressive. It's also because of your ability to, as you put it, \"purify\" Abyssal power.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150360306
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Skirk"
				},
				{
					"id": 150360306,
					"content": "Whatever that actually means... The fact is that ability allowed him to do something that should have been completely impossible:",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150360307
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Skirk"
				},
				{
					"id": 150360307,
					"content": "Namely, break through my defenses and steal my power.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150360308,
						150360309
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Skirk"
				},
				{
					"id": 150360308,
					"content": "So, you were his real target?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150360310
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 150360310,
					"content": "No, he couldn't have known I'd come to his domain. He only stole your soul fragment because he knew the value of its power. I doubt he expected it to come in handy so soon.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150360311
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Skirk"
				},
				{
					"id": 150360311,
					"content": "Call it \"fate\" if you want. I believe that's the term they use in this world for arbitrary coincidences like this.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150360312
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Skirk"
				},
				{
					"id": 150360312,
					"content": "In any case, it works to our advantage. Once I realized what he was using that power for, it gave me the chance to get back what you lost.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150360313
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Skirk"
				},
				{
					"id": 150360313,
					"content": "But, you...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150360314
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 150360314,
					"content": "I'll cope.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150360315
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Skirk"
				},
				{
					"id": 150360315,
					"content": "Well, done gorging? Good. Time to answer some questions.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150360316
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Skirk"
				},
				{
					"id": 150360316,
					"content": "How did you get the power of the All-Devouring Narwhal?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150360317
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Skirk"
				},
				{
					"id": 150360317,
					"content": "The All-Devouring Narwhal!?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150360318
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 150360318,
					"content": "Ohh... of course! Paimon knew that spike thing looked familiar! It looks just like that narwhal's horn!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150360319
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 150360319,
					"content": "I highly doubt you acquired that power through your own strength. Tell me I'm wrong.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150360320
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Skirk"
				},
				{
					"id": 150360320,
					"content": "You're desperate enough to scour the land for god remains and whatever vestiges of power you can find. That alone proves you wouldn't be able to defeat a creature like that.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150360321
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Skirk"
				},
				{
					"id": 150360321,
					"content": "Which leaves one possibility — you know my master, \"The Foul\" Surtalogi.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150360322
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Skirk"
				},
				{
					"id": 150360322,
					"content": "\"The Foul\"...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150360323
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Skofnungr"
				},
				{
					"id": 150360323,
					"content": "Who dares call him \"foul\"? Surtalogi...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150360324
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Skofnungr"
				},
				{
					"id": 150360324,
					"content": "Surta... logi...!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150360325
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Skofnungr"
				},
				{
					"id": 150360325,
					"content": "What's wrong, bit off more power than you can chew? You're struggling to hold a basic conversation...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150360326
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Skirk"
				},
				{
					"id": 150360326,
					"content": "Just a little longer. I'm still...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150360327
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Skofnungr"
				},
				{
					"id": 150360327,
					"content": "Look! It's back!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150360328
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 150360328,
					"content": "Those obsessed with power will let it devour them before abandoning their pursuit.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150360329
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Skirk"
				},
				{
					"id": 150360329,
					"content": "What should we do now?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150360330
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 150360330,
					"content": "Keep calm and use reason to decide the best course of action.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150360331
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Skirk"
				},
				{
					"id": 150360331,
					"content": "(Skirk was stabbed by one of the spikes while retrieving the fragment of my soul, and in the process, some of her power was stolen.)",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150360332
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 150360332,
					"content": "(The culprit is hiding somewhere beyond the fog. I have a good understanding of his attack pattern from the fight just now. If we pursue him, our chances of winning are high.)",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150360333
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 150360333,
					"content": "(But, Skirk's breathing is weaker than usual. If we attack now, I can't guarantee her or Paimon's safety. It's a hard decision to make, but...)",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150360334
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 150360334,
					"content": "I think we should get out of here.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150360335
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 150360335,
					"content": "Wise decision. Final victory doesn't always come after a single battle.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150360336
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Skirk"
				},
				{
					"id": 150360336,
					"content": "You've got your soul fragment back, so we both got what we came for. Let the enemy draw breath while he can. It won't be for long.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150360337
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Skirk"
				},
				{
					"id": 150360337,
					"content": "#Get us out of here, {NICKNAME}. You'll need to lead the way this time.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Skirk"
				},
				{
					"id": 150360309,
					"content": "He was after you from the very beginning?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150360310
					]
				}
			]
		},
