			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 150360501,
					"content": "Phew... Uh... We should be safe here, right?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150360502
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 150360502,
					"content": "I no longer sense his presence. Can't have followed us out of that Abyssal domain.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150360503
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Skirk"
				},
				{
					"id": 150360503,
					"content": "Weaklings like him will find that my power is not so easily controlled. He won't be leaving that place until he's managed to digest it.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150360504,
						150360505
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Skirk"
				},
				{
					"id": 150360504,
					"content": "The All-Devouring Narwhal...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150360506
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 150360506,
					"content": "You seem surprised.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150360507
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Skirk"
				},
				{
					"id": 150360507,
					"content": "I suppose that's fair... You've seen but a fraction of what that whale is capable of. That gaping maw could swallow a planet whole.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150360508
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Skirk"
				},
				{
					"id": 150360508,
					"content": "It's called the All-Devouring Narwhal for a reason — \"devouring\" is what it does best. It can extract power from anything, dead or alive, as long as it manages to make physical contact.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150360509
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Skirk"
				},
				{
					"id": 150360509,
					"content": "Yeah, when we had our run-in with that thing, Neuvillette mentioned that it has an \"instinct to devour\"...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150360510
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 150360510,
					"content": "Your dragon friend recognized the nature of its abilities and used the power of Hydro to protect you. That worked because it was in a satiated state, so it was somewhat less aggressive than usual.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150360511
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Skirk"
				},
				{
					"id": 150360511,
					"content": "It's a different story when it has no more power to feed off of. That's when its true, voracious nature kicks in. It could devour everything on the planet in that state — which is why I cast it into that void space...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150360512
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Skirk"
				},
				{
					"id": 150360512,
					"content": "But, I hadn't counted on there being anyone left on this planet capable of wielding its power. To me, that says he must have encountered the whale a long time ago — meaning, he must have known my master.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150360513
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Skirk"
				},
				{
					"id": 150360513,
					"content": "Yeah, hearing you say \"The Foul\" definitely got a reaction out of him.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150360514
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 150360514,
					"content": "Exactly, it told me everything I needed to know. Hence why I said, we both got what we came for.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150360515
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Skirk"
				},
				{
					"id": 150360515,
					"content": "And I believe that brings our transaction to an end. Now that you're whole again, you can get back to your own journey. I'll handle the rest of this situation myself.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150360516
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Skirk"
				},
				{
					"id": 150360516,
					"content": "No way, we can't leave now! Something was stolen from you because of us! We have to help you get it back!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150360517
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 150360517,
					"content": "This isn't my first taste of failure or losing power. When you fall, you get back up again and become stronger, that's how it is.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150360518
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Skirk"
				},
				{
					"id": 150360518,
					"content": "But... What if that monster finds you before you're all better?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150360519
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 150360519,
					"content": "Plus, how are you gonna get home? It's not like you can just go \"swoosh\" and open a door to the Abyss again. Not without your full strength!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150360520
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 150360520,
					"content": "So, sticking with us for the time being doesn't sound so bad, does it?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150360521,
						150360522
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 150360521,
					"content": "It's not out of pity.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150360523
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 150360523,
					"content": "...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150360524
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Skirk"
				},
				{
					"id": 150360524,
					"content": "Fair enough. Then, take this.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150360525
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Skirk"
				},
				{
					"id": 150360525,
					"content": "Uh, what is it?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150360526
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 150360526,
					"content": "A bag of Mora. Nothing in this world is free — I know that much.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150360527
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Skirk"
				},
				{
					"id": 150360527,
					"content": "I'll leave the planning to you. Hurry up and decide where to go. We shouldn't linger.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Skirk"
				},
				{
					"id": 150360522,
					"content": "You said I don't want to be in your debt. Well, I still am.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150360523
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 150360505,
					"content": "With its power, he even managed to steal from you of all people...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150360506
					]
				}
			]
		},
