			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 150360601,
					"content": "Huh, this bag from Skirk has a ton of Mora in it...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150360602
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 150360602,
					"content": "Does she have a job or something? Wait, no. After what we saw at Wanmin Restaurant, that seems impossible. Can you imagine? It would go something like...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150360603
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 150360603,
					"content": "\"I'll be collecting my paycheck now, Boss.\"",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150360604
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 150360604,
					"content": "\"Oh, sure thing! Wait, who are you? Have we met?\"",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150360605
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 150360605,
					"content": "Hm, can't hold a job if you make everyone forget about you. So, what did she do to get all this Mora...?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150360606
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 150360606,
					"content": "Ugh... Claimed some buried treasure, took care of a few monsters that were causing trouble... Nothing untoward. It's safe to use.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150360607
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Skirk"
				},
				{
					"id": 150360607,
					"content": "Aaaah! You heard all that?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150360608
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 150360608,
					"content": "A... sonorous voice like yours is hard to miss. I wouldn't be surprised if the sound of it traveled to the nearest mountain top.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150360609
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Skirk"
				},
				{
					"id": 150360609,
					"content": "Then, did you, by chance, happen to hear Paimon's little, um... joke earlier?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150360610
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 150360610,
					"content": "You mean when you called me \"Frosty the Lavender Melon\"?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150360611,
						150360612
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Skirk"
				},
				{
					"id": 150360611,
					"content": "Guess you did, heh...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150360613
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 150360613,
					"content": "No, no. Sorry, Paimon totally misspoke just now. She didn't say that at all! It was... a Paimon look-alike! Yeah, she's a piece of work, that one. Always impersonating Paimon and giving people weird nicknames! Hehe...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150360614
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 150360614,
					"content": "#...Okay, fine. The truth is Paimon didn't like you all that much at the start — but things are different now! You helped {NICKNAME} in a big way, so... Whaddaya say? Friends?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150360615
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 150360615,
					"content": "...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150360616
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Skirk"
				},
				{
					"id": 150360616,
					"content": "I noticed there was only one bed. Go ahead and get some rest.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150360617
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Skirk"
				},
				{
					"id": 150360617,
					"content": "Wait, what about you?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150360618
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 150360618,
					"content": "I don't get tired, and I don't need rest. I'm going to practice my sword work. That should help me regain some strength.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150360619
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Skirk"
				},
				{
					"id": 150360619,
					"content": "But, your shoulder! Hey! Don't just leave!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150360620
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 150360620,
					"content": "Argh, whatever. Let her tire herself out. She'll come back eventually.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150360621
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 150360621,
					"content": "#Let's get some sleep, {NICKNAME}! That comfy bed is calling Paimon!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150360622
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 150360622,
					"content": "(Skirk is stubborn. Even if I tried to convince her to take it easy, I doubt she'd listen.)",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150360623
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 150360623,
					"content": "(Paimon is right. Skirk will stop and take a break once she gets tired... I hope. I should just get some sleep.)",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150360624
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 150360624,
					"content": "*panting*",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150360625
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Skirk"
				},
				{
					"id": 150360625,
					"content": "(Skirk...?)",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150360626
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 150360626,
					"content": "(Of course she's acting like she didn't just get stabbed in the shoulder. Huh, something seems off with her though...)",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150360627
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 150360627,
					"content": "*panting*...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150360628
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Skirk"
				},
				{
					"id": 150360628,
					"content": "...Quiet.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150360629
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Skirk"
				},
				{
					"id": 150360629,
					"content": "(Who's she talking to? There's no one around. Unless...)",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150360630
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 150360630,
					"content": "Do you even remember how many of us perished in that fire? How many bodies were left to rot on the scorched earth? Yet, you alone live on.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150360631
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Panicked Passerby"
				},
				{
					"id": 150360631,
					"content": "Keep your gaze fixed on your blade. You don't deserve to rest.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150360632
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Panicked Passerby"
				},
				{
					"id": 150360632,
					"content": "Run, Skirk... Run! Only death awaits us here. Keep running, and don't ever look back...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150360633
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Cheerful Male Voice"
				},
				{
					"id": 150360633,
					"content": "(Right! In that dream I witnessed, Skirk was training alone, but there were disembodied voices talking to her.)",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150360634
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 150360634,
					"content": "(One of them mentioned a fire... I wonder what happened exactly. If only she could just talk to us...)",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150360635
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 150360635,
					"content": "Ahhh, getting an early night's sleep is the best! That bed was sooo comfy!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150360636
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 150360636,
					"content": "Wait, Skirk? Have you been sitting out here the whole night? The bed's all yours if you want it!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150360637
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 150360637,
					"content": "...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150360638
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Skirk"
				},
				{
					"id": 150360638,
					"content": "Recovered your strength yet?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150360639
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 150360639,
					"content": "About 60 percent, maybe 70.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150360640
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Skirk"
				},
				{
					"id": 150360640,
					"content": "Whoa, Paimon thought it would take at least a couple of days! That was fast!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150360641
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 150360641,
					"content": "No... Not fast enough.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150360642
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Skirk"
				},
				{
					"id": 150360642,
					"content": "That's 20 percent less than last time. Same training regimen, same intensity. Nothing felt different, but somehow, the outcome fell short.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150360643
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Skirk"
				},
				{
					"id": 150360643,
					"content": "Maybe it's because of the spike that stabbed you?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150360644
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 150360644,
					"content": "No, I think the problem's with me.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150360645
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Skirk"
				},
				{
					"id": 150360645,
					"content": "I need to meditate for the next two days. Deep introspection should help me find the issue.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150360646
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Skirk"
				},
				{
					"id": 150360646,
					"content": "Whoa, sounds intense! We'll watch over you in the meantime, then!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150360647
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 150360647,
					"content": "Thanks. See you in two days.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Skirk"
				},
				{
					"id": 150360612,
					"content": "Paimon's whispering needs some work.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150360613
					]
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 1503650,
